#= Stack Specific Settings
#== Stalwart
STALWART_HOSTNAME: stalwart
## Public web hostname on the bare domain. The WebUI, JMAP, SCIM, and account
## manager all answer on https://<this>.<DOMAIN_NAME>.
STALWART_SERVICE_NAME: mail
## Issued by Stalwart Labs. Settings > Enterprise reads it from the container's environment.
STALWART_LICENSE_KEY: [[STALWART_LICENSE_KEY]]
